  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3602.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement filing, notice, and exchange requirements for the New Hampshire long-term care partnership program.\n\nSource. #9654, eff 2-16-10; ss by #12472, eff 2-16-18",
